      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_027.wav",
      "subtitle": "可是，要是你退出的话——"
    },
    {
      "slug": "tomori",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "tomori",
      "speakerId": "adv_tomori",
      "text": "那时……我没有把歌唱好。\n害得乐队四分五裂",
