      "slug": "tomori",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "tomori",
      "speakerId": "adv_tomori",
      "text": "我好难受，好难受，\n我已经不想再经历这种事了……\n还觉得以后……再也不想组乐队了……",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_13_38",
